From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 17:11:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] windows.storage: FileIO, PathIO and streamed files

Windows.Storage.FileIO and PathIO (IFileIOStatics / IPathIOStatics, added to the
IDL): ReadText/WriteText/AppendText, ReadLines/WriteLines/AppendLines with and
without an encoding, ReadBuffer/WriteBuffer/WriteBytes. UTF-8 is the default for
writing (no byte order mark), reading detects a UTF-8/UTF-16 mark; lines are
split on CRLF, LF or CR and joined with CRLF. The line list is a working
IVector<String> (with a view and iterator). A relative path or a null file is
E_INVALIDARG; file errors arrive in the finished operation.
Streamed files: StorageFile.CreateStreamedFileAsync / ReplaceWithStreamedFileAsync
run the application's handler (on a thread of its own) with a
StreamedFileDataRequest (IOutputStream, IClosable, FailAndClose) and keep the data
in a file under the temporary directory; ...FromUri copies file:, ms-appx: and
ms-appdata: sources. IDL: StreamedFileDataRequest, StreamedFileFailureMode.

